        ("1 of 3", "brass sheet, 0.032 in (0.81 mm), 4 × 10 in", L["sheet032"], "K&S 253 three-pack, Amazon B0006MZM1O", "about $17 for three",
         f"The lid plate ({D['lid']:.1f} mm square with the Ø25.2 hole the tower passes through), the four 6 mm stops inside the cube, the drum's floor disc (Ø15.2) and a strip for the motor's hot-glue stop. Cut with the jeweler's saw, filed to the line. Half a sheet; the rest is stock for every brass build. The hologram's and the rover's 0.005 in sheet is too thin for these."),
